  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Even after fulfilling her dreams of becoming a magazine editor and living in Seoul, Go Su-A can't seem to shake the feeling that something is still missing. When a difficult day at work and an argument with her mother drives her to get a tattoo, Su-A bumps into the last person she expected to see: her first love, Baek Hu-Beom. This encounter rekindles old feelings and sparks questions about what happened between them nine years ago, but will Su-A be able to muster up the courage to ask them? \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
